WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.062
[Gentle music]
This is SharpLsp in VS Code. Open a folder with a solution or a project, and SharpLsp loads it, with C# and F# side by side.

00:13.150 --> 00:18.934
F# is first class. The F# compiler answers every hover, completion and jump.

00:27.550 --> 00:34.396
C# runs on Roslyn, the compiler itself, for completion, diagnostics, fixes and refactorings.

00:50.017 --> 01:02.286
And the tools come with it: a profiler, a NuGet browser, test lenses and debugging. Install SharpLsp from the Marketplace or Open VSX. It's free, and open source.
